<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32993" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτημόρ-ιοι</span></b> , οἱ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκτα τῶν γινομένων
					τελοῦντες</span>
			, those <i>who paid a sixth</i> (or <i>five-sixths) of the
				produce</i> as rent, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				13
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτήμοροι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτημόριον, τό</span>, <i>a sixth part</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				10.140
			</span></i>, Protag.Nicae. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
				3.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτήμορος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύαθος</span>), ὁ, a
				<i>liquid measure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				1.80
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
